h('9.2 Presentation and continuous demo')
para('Ten slides include speaker notes for approximately 8.5 minutes. The 3:30 video follows: room/controls, lamp, CCTV, spotlights, alarm, reset, source diagnostics, continuous laser route and safe opening. Captions identify features and FPS stays visible. The final attempt has no cuts.')
para('The defense guide covers MVP/normal matrices, hierarchy, inverse-box contact, Blinn-Phong, skinning, FBO feedback avoidance and fixed-step input. It distinguishes implementation from remaining native-input, TA-machine and course-starter checks. Actual submission and access invitations are separate human actions.')
